  "description": "<div class=\"sc-llYSUQ bhKSKZ pf-4_ pf-r pf-r-eh\" data-pf-type=\"Row\">\r\n<div class=\"pf-c\">\r\n<div class=\"sc-bilyIR egurxi pf-3_\" data-pf-type=\"Column\">\r\n<h3 class=\"sc-iUKqMP iPshnk pf-8_\" data-pf-type=\"Heading\"><span class=\"sc-gjNHFA gwWIgj pf-7_\" data-pf-type=\"Text\">Earn Consistent Money Selling Our Watches!</span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"sc-llYSUQ bhKSKZ pf-13_ pf-r pf-r-eh\" data-pf-type=\"Row\">\r\n<div class=\"pf-c\">\r\n<div class=\"sc-bilyIR egurxi pf-12_\" data-pf-type=\"Column\">\r\n<p>Hey! If you're reading this, it isn't too late to join our brand ambassador program at PIVOT Watches! First, we would like to thank you for considering joining our PIVOT team. We know there is a lot of great brands that you could work with, and we are happy that you are thinking of partnering with us. I am sure now you're wondering, \"What is PIVOT Watches?\". Let us tell you a little bit about us and our mission here at PIVOT.</p>\r\n<p>PIVOT Watches was launched in 2021 with the goal to help empower likeminded people that want to go chase their dreams. At PIVOT we know that time is not just precious, but an opportunity for transformation. Change is a constant in life, and at PIVOT, we understand embracing change is the key to personal growth. We believe that everyone has a unique PIVOT, whether it's a new career, focusing on your goals, or starting your passion. Our watches are more than just a stylish accessory, they serve as a powerful reminder to step outside of your comfort zone and conquer your fears.</p>\r\n<p>Don&rsquo;t wait! Join us on this journey and spread the word about PIVOT Watches where you will get 20% commission on total referral sales when a customer makes a purchase through your affiliate link! Together, let's embrace change, chase our dreams, and conquer our own PIVOT's.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>+ Commissions paid weekly</p>\r\n<p>+ Earn extra $ for sharing our content with your affiliate link</p>\r\n<p>+ Support small businesses</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
